(7318195, 1141612, 147314, '<td valign="top">Congrats on the Blue, Paul, well deserved. Fun thing is I was looking for numbers on sheep as well for this challenge, but here on Skye they only use coloured stains. Glad I didn''t find them, no way to compete with the master :-)</td>', 'Congrats on the Blue, Paul, well deserved. Fun thing is I was looking for numbers on sheep as well for this challenge, but here on Skye they only use coloured stains. Glad I didn''t find them, no way to compete with the master :-)', '2015-02-18 03:35:42.000000', NULL, 0),
(7318196, 1141612, 135744, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Kroburg:</b></div><hr/><i> Congrats on the Blue, Paul, well deserved. Fun thing is I was looking for numbers on sheep as well for this challenge, but here on Skye they only use coloured stains. Glad I didn''t find them, no way to compete with the master :-) </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Thanks Kees, I am sure those cute Scottish sheep would have given the Somerset sheep a run for their money.<br/> <br/>I am always on the lookout for some sheep like these if you happen to have any like this?<br/> <br/><img alt="'' . substr(''https://s-media-cache-ec0.pinimg.com/736x/2a/f2/20/2af220e2e08a61226915d69b809ab3b8.jpg'', strrpos(''https://s-media-cache-ec0.pinimg.com/736x/2a/f2/20/2af220e2e08a61226915d69b809ab3b8.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="https://s-media-cache-ec0.pinimg.com/736x/2a/f2/20/2af220e2e08a61226915d69b809ab3b8.jpg"/></td>', 'Originally posted by Kroburg: Congrats on the Blue, Paul, well deserved. Fun thing is I was looking for numbers on sheep as well for this challenge, but here on Skye they only use coloured stains. Glad I didn''t find them, no way to compete with the master :-)   Thanks Kees, I am sure those cute Scottish sheep would have given the Somerset sheep a run for their money. I am always on the lookout for some sheep like these if you happen to have any like this? ', '2015-02-18 04:13:10.000000', NULL, 0),
