(7318200, 1141641, 163430, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by backdoorhippie:</b></div><hr/><i> <table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by damjanev:</b></div><hr/><i> If only there was 5318008 on the calculator display ;-) </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>What, 58008 wasn''t enough?! Boobies wouldn''t have fit in the composition.  ;) </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>The font was obscuring the message. It is not complete without calculator LCD typeface :-)<br/>Congrats on the Top10.</td>', 'Originally posted by backdoorhippie: Originally posted by damjanev: If only there was 5318008 on the calculator display ;-)   What, 58008 wasn''t enough?! Boobies wouldn''t have fit in the composition.  ;)   The font was obscuring the message. It is not complete without calculator LCD typeface :-)Congrats on the Top10.', '2015-02-18 04:54:32.000000', NULL, 0),
